---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Project Brief" description="Implementation reference for the AutoEvolve project.">
  <section class="page-section page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Planning artifact</p>
    <h1>Project Brief</h1>
    <p>
      The repository includes a detailed implementation brief at <code>start_brief.md</code>. It defines the mission,
      architecture, content model, editorial policy, and delivery plan used to build this site.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="page-section article-content">
    <h2>How to Use It</h2>
    <p>
      Treat the brief as the source of truth for future implementation decisions. When features, content rules, or
      deployment choices change, update the brief or a follow-on decision record before changing the system.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
